Package: montyhall
Title: Simulate the Monty Hall Problem
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mariana", "Ozaeta", , "mozaeta12@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds and plays the Monty Hall Problem game. The package
    creates a game, walks through each step of play, and simulates many
    games to compare the stay and switch strategies.
Depends:
    dplyr
